{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8352F660","title":"Salt Pete talks about the treasure","entry":"Dlg_8352F660::entry","exit":"Dlg_8352F660::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_5DC61E9F","articyId":"72057624102717778","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Hey, you didn't sink. I'm not surprised about that at all. What did you think of the boat?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, you didn't sink. I'm not surprised about that at all. What did you think of the boat?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22766","byteOffset":16497168,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_4DAE074D","articyId":"72057624102717802","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"The ocean swells with promise and adventure young Mariner! Only the lucky few are destined to heed the call. A pelagic wonder world awaits.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The ocean swells with promise and adventure young Mariner! Only the lucky few are destined to heed the call. A pelagic wonder world awaits.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17183","byteOffset":14390400,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_EDF8B8DE","articyId":"72057624102717823","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Well.. I do have a task in mind. Something that could benefit BOTH of us greatly. But first... what did you think of The Putter?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well.. I do have a task in mind. Something that could benefit BOTH of us greatly. But first... what did you think of The Putter?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30916","byteOffset":19579272,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_F5877B65","articyId":"72057624102717853","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"You might wonder why such transport exists in a city with HOVA's, Vinculum Ascenders and supersonic locomotives.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You might wonder why such transport exists in a city with HOVA's, Vinculum Ascenders and supersonic locomotives.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28969","byteOffset":18842840,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_DE42D206","articyId":"72057624102717876","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"We'll make a sailor of yea yet! Indeed. HOVA's are linked to The Grid. Sure, they can fly off Grid, but they can't draw power, and with the lack of clean water down here, they got no fuel. And of course CorpSec are likely to fine ya if you're down here.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We'll make a sailor of yea yet! Indeed. HOVA's are linked to The Grid. Sure, they can fly off Grid, but they can't draw power, and with the lack of clean water down here, they got no fuel. And of course CorpSec are likely to fine ya if you're down here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20076","byteOffset":15480232,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_222E5509","articyId":"72057624102717883","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"HOVA's are linked to The Grid. Sure, they can fly off Grid, but they can't draw power, and with the lack of clean water down here, they got no fuel. And of course CorpSec are likely to fine ya if you're down here.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"HOVA's are linked to The Grid. Sure, they can fly off Grid, but they can't draw power, and with the lack of clean water down here, they got no fuel. And of course CorpSec are likely to fine ya if you're down here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51919","byteOffset":34056688,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_28CBA205","articyId":"72057624102717896","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Fancier? Look, The Putter might not win any prizes for her looks, but she's designed with arcane tech so advanced, no one alive really knows how it works any more. She's a technological marvel.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Fancier? Look, The Putter might not win any prizes for her looks, but she's designed with arcane tech so advanced, no one alive really knows how it works any more. She's a technological marvel.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21031","byteOffset":15838800,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_9CD3BC59","articyId":"72057624102717911","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"The Putter draws power from The Firmament - an archaic energy field that predates The Grid. She also automatically processes Grade 8 water to for a backup uranium power cell. That's water so dirty you can slice it.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Putter draws power from The Firmament - an archaic energy field that predates The Grid. She also automatically processes Grade 8 water to for a backup uranium power cell. That's water so dirty you can slice it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37835","byteOffset":28649264,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_764F0718","articyId":"72057624102717924","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"That's just the start of it. Ferro fibrous balance cores to keep her stable, micro-detergent cores in the rudder to resist acidic bacterial colonies, two-way myomers in the mast to survive storms up to intensity level 8. She's not a sailboat, she's a battleship.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's just the start of it. Ferro fibrous balance cores to keep her stable, micro-detergent cores in the rudder to resist acidic bacterial colonies, two-way myomers in the mast to survive storms up to intensity level 8. She's not a sailboat, she's a battleship.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51275","byteOffset":33812216,"byteLength":608}},{"id":"DFr_9BF4F0E0","articyId":"72057624102717939","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"I was being poetic. But I reckon when Nivalis finally topples into the sea, she'll be all that's left.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I was being poetic. But I reckon when Nivalis finally topples into the sea, she'll be all that's left.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51908","byteOffset":34052808,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_3C00AEA6","articyId":"72057624102717952","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Now as regards what you can do with her...","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now as regards what you can do with her...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41002","byteOffset":29840104,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_42E78ED1","articyId":"72057624102717967","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Haha, absolutely not. She's not sellable. Contaminated, rotten, and registered with the Sailing Guild as a protected relic. No, you can't sell her. But that's not to say she won't lead you to a fortune.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha, absolutely not. She's not sellable. Contaminated, rotten, and registered with the Sailing Guild as a protected relic. No, you can't sell her. But that's not to say she won't lead you to a fortune.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48118","byteOffset":32540504,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_3AD0DFDF","articyId":"72057624102717981","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Finding Lost Tech on unreachable shores, dredging the depths for ancient CPU cores, smuggling goods into the sub-Spire warrens, finding the very rarest fishing grounds - the limit is your imagination!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Finding Lost Tech on unreachable shores, dredging the depths for ancient CPU cores, smuggling goods into the sub-Spire warrens, finding the very rarest fishing grounds - the limit is your imagination!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":6600.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45990","byteOffset":31730928,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_68ADC874","articyId":"72057624102717995","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"And I got something a little spicier for ya. I mentioned I had a task in mind... Well me and my EX shipmates lost some... cargo. I'm going to need your help finding it.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And I got something a little spicier for ya. I mentioned I had a task in mind... Well me and my EX shipmates lost some... cargo. I'm going to need your help finding it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7200.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34414","byteOffset":20902528,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_BCDB702A","articyId":"72057624102718016","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"A boat.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A boat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":7800.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32588","byteOffset":20211408,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_E3E17401","articyId":"72057624102718030","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"I'll send some information to your Automata. Just let me find the old map.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll send some information to your Automata. Just let me find the old map.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8400.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22304","byteOffset":16323640,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_174EC6CE","articyId":"72057624102717788","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It seems useful...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It seems useful...","TextSheVersion":"It seems useful...","TextTheyVersion":"It seems useful..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32735","byteOffset":20268648,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_29F4BE41","articyId":"72057624102717795","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't know what to do with it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know what to do with it.","TextSheVersion":"I don't know what to do with it.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't know what to do with it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27070","byteOffset":18120632,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_7806A425","articyId":"72057624102717809","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"But what can I DO with it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But what can I DO with it?","TextSheVersion":"But what can I DO with it?","TextTheyVersion":"But what can I DO with it?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],